{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1518735-playing-v5-sabbat","id":1518735,"title":"Playing V5 Sabbat","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-07-24T19:48:54-07:00","id":1518735,"title":"Playing V5 Sabbat","content":"So I recently picked up the STV Playing the Sabbat book. Anyone have feedback on using this resource? Anyone doing a hybrid of V5 rules but using V20 Path rules?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3761-yab","name":"Yab","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-24T19:56:26-07:00","id":1518736,"title":"","content":"I've found &quot;The Long Hard Road Out of Hell&quot; more useful. I run V5 Sabbat games routinely, but I mostly use my own homebrew, heavily influenced by TLHROOH, to do so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-24T19:59:35-07:00","id":1518737,"title":"","content":"Thanks for mentioning it. I will check it out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3761-yab","name":"Yab","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-25T01:52:42-07:00","id":1518746,"title":"","content":"Theirs a lot of really solid stuff on storytellers vault. Long hard road os very good. Avoid khelils however that's very v5 path.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-25T17:04:56-07:00","id":1518793,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1518735-playing-v5-sabbat?p=1518746#post1518746\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Theirs a lot of really solid stuff on storytellers vault. Long hard road os very good. Avoid khelils however that's very v5 path.</div> </div> </div> </div>Could you please list some more supplements from Storyteller's Vault that you are quite certain about that they would be interesting, good, and valueable ? Would be very nice.<br /> I was thinking recently about the Storyteller's Vault, and all the various works contained and placed at this place that is quite unique and very important.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-25T18:36:22-07:00","id":1518798,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yab</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1518735-playing-v5-sabbat#post1518735\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I recently picked up the STV Playing the Sabbat book. Anyone have feedback on using this resource? Anyone doing a hybrid of V5 rules but using V20 Path rules?</div> </div> </div> </div>Storytelling wise, I think this is one of the worst books ever written for V:TM and I have been a huge defender of V5. About the only way I can recommend playing V5 Sabbat is to suggest that you should take, of all places, hints from the Star Wars Legends verse and Empire. The Sabbat is collapsing and you are some of the few &quot;sane&quot; members left who see how the sect is doomed to become a bunch of idiots ruled by idiots with the only possible result of staying being Final Death for no purpose whatsoever.<br /> <br /> So, clearly, YOU MUST MAKE YOUR OWN SABBAT.<br /> <br /> The game becomes trying to gather as many people to join your secret machinations and either steal a city to form your own Sabbat from or infiltrate the Camarilla as a parasite, Palpatine style.<br /> <br /> Maybe defect to the Anarchs and plan to slowly turn them into a newer Sabbat.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-25T20:26:54-07:00","id":1518803,"title":"","content":"CTPhipps, you're not a fan of the general V5 take on the Sabbat in general, never mind the decision to not support Sabbat games with Path updates and touchstone rules for the inhumane?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3761-yab","name":"Yab","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-25T22:16:34-07:00","id":1518812,"title":"","content":"In my games, the Sabbat was taken over by Cathari Demagogues in the wake of Regent Galbraith's disappearance. The Cathari Demagogues were a disaster for the Sabbat, being completely focused on hedonism and a kind of short-sighted populism. Cathari packs began to raise shovelheads to True Sabbat status the moment they displayed devotion to the path, rather than waiting until they'd displayed consistent tactical wisdom the way most packs did. This absolutely swelled the ranks of the Cathari making it, by far, the biggest Path of Enlightenment in the Sabbat. Their idiocy lost the Sabbat several important cities.<br /> <br /> The packs devoted to more disciplined Paths quickly became sick of drowning in Cathari idiocy. The breaking point came when the Cathari Demagogues claimed that the Sabbat was &quot;more dangerous than ever&quot; without cities to call their own, and that the Sabbat &quot;was better off without our own cities&quot;.<br /> <br /> The packs devoted to other paths saw this as the most absurd and insulting propaganda imaginable. Just sheer idiocy masquerading as a political message. So they backed a Sabbat Inquisition takeover of the Sabbat. The Regent position was abolished, and the Grand Inquisitor became the leading position of the Sabbat, with the Sabbat Inquisition as a whole just below her.<br /> <br /> The Cathari were declared heretical and purged in a civil war, and New Orleans became the new capital of the Sabbat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-25T22:41:51-07:00","id":1518815,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1518735-playing-v5-sabbat?p=1518798#post1518798\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">About the only way I can recommend playing V5 Sabbat is to suggest that you should take, of all places, hints from the Star Wars Legends verse and Empire. The Sabbat is collapsing and you are some of the few &quot;sane&quot; members left who see how the sect is doomed to become a bunch of idiots ruled by idiots with the only possible result of staying being Final Death for no purpose whatsoever.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just be careful<br /> A Grand Admiral Thrawn version of a Sabbat leader who appears (ala Heirs of the Sabbat style) potentially could mean the very end of the Camarilla (and everyone else) <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-26T07:07:51-07:00","id":1518822,"title":"","content":"Grand Admiral Thrawn you say...So Polonia then? lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3215-supersabbatst","name":"SuperSabbatST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"196"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-26T07:17:16-07:00","id":1518823,"title":"","content":"More like Vasantasena<br /> But Thrawn, I think, would be a True Brujah or Toreador on the Path of the Scorched Heart <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-26T08:29:26-07:00","id":1518826,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Muad'Dib</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1518735-playing-v5-sabbat?p=1518793#post1518793\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Could you please list some more supplements from Storyteller's Vault that you are quite certain about that they would be interesting, good, and valueable ? Would be very nice.<br /> I was thinking recently about the Storyteller's Vault, and all the various works contained and placed at this place that is quite unique and very important.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/374164/Guide-to-the-Sabbat\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.storytellersvault.com/pr...-to-the-Sabbat</a> - This one is my preferred one when I have to play V5.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/374104/The-Sword-of-Caine-A-V5-Guide-to-the-Sabbat\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.storytellersvault.com/pr...-to-the-Sabbat</a> - Not my fave but others like<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/385327/The-Black-Hand-Playing-the-Sabbat\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.storytellersvault.com/pr...ing-the-Sabbat</a> - The &quot;official&quot; one....its almost as bad as the V5 Sabbat book. Avoid.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/394797/The-True-Hand\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.storytellersvault.com/pr.../The-True-Hand</a> - An...interesting...take on the True Black Hand....worth a look even if it might not be your cup of tea.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/386171/The-Three-Free-Clans-An-Alternate-Look-at-the-Sabbat\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.storytellersvault.com/pr...-at-the-Sabbat</a> - An alt-history version of the Sabbat...different...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-26T09:12:42-07:00","id":1518828,"title":"","content":"In our game the Sabbat has largely fallen apart as they found out there the war with the antideulivans had no effect on there schemes and the two they thought they killed were alive and well and found it amusing as the knowledge set that the Sabbat elders were playing checkers against beings who were playing high level chess and were ten moves ahead of them.<br /> <br /> That said there is still a few roving packs around causing trouble, but it's just now a nusicance as the sect as lost the political and spiritual leaders to the Camarilla or Anarchs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-26T11:40:01-07:00","id":1518834,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1518735-playing-v5-sabbat?p=1518812#post1518812\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In my games, the Sabbat was taken over by Cathari Demagogues in the wake of Regent Galbraith's disappearance. The Cathari Demagogues were a disaster for the Sabbat, being completely focused on hedonism and a kind of short-sighted populism. Cathari packs began to raise shovelheads to True Sabbat status the moment they displayed devotion to the path, rather than waiting until they'd displayed consistent tactical wisdom the way most packs did. This absolutely swelled the ranks of the Cathari making it, by far, the biggest Path of Enlightenment in the Sabbat. Their idiocy lost the Sabbat several important cities.<br /> <br /> The packs devoted to more disciplined Paths quickly became sick of drowning in Cathari idiocy. The breaking point came when the Cathari Demagogues claimed that the Sabbat was &quot;more dangerous than ever&quot; without cities to call their own, and that the Sabbat &quot;was better off without our own cities&quot;.<br /> <br /> The packs devoted to other paths saw this as the most absurd and insulting propaganda imaginable. Just sheer idiocy masquerading as a political message. So they backed a Sabbat Inquisition takeover of the Sabbat. The Regent position was abolished, and the Grand Inquisitor became the leading position of the Sabbat, with the Sabbat Inquisition as a whole just below her.<br /> <br /> The Cathari were declared heretical and purged in a civil war, and New Orleans became the new capital of the Sabbat.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I personally downplayed the sabbats collapse and had them simply start taking the masquerade more seriously as well as having a more 'nurtering ' approach to neonates and only doing mass embraces as specific 'boot camps I also had the both the salubri and ravnos as de jour Sabbat clans now. Then again I backed it up by making the anarchs have some actual ideas on how to achieve a more egalitarian society going forward.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-26T11:46:15-07:00","id":1518835,"title":"","content":"I do like the idea of the Ravnos and Salubri antitribu becoming more prominent within the Sabbat due to (at least by old canon) their Antedeluvians actually being destroyed. Has V5 covered why the Tzimisce are starting to recede from the Sabbat, if not so much as the Lasombra?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3761-yab","name":"Yab","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-26T12:12:19-07:00","id":1518837,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yab</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1518735-playing-v5-sabbat?p=1518835#post1518835\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I do like the idea of the Ravnos and Salubri antitribu becoming more prominent within the Sabbat due to (at least by old canon) their Antedeluvians actually being destroyed. Has V5 covered why the Tzimisce are starting to recede from the Sabbat, if not so much as the Lasombra?</div> </div> </div> </div>not really, it's mostly for the meta reason Sabbat arnt really playable in v5 so. I got the impression most of them still are but their are just contingents in the other sects now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-26T13:25:08-07:00","id":1518842,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1518735-playing-v5-sabbat?p=1518834#post1518834\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I personally downplayed the sabbats collapse and had them simply start taking the masquerade more seriously as well as having a more 'nurtering ' approach to neonates and only doing mass embraces as specific 'boot camps I also had the both the salubri and ravnos as de jour Sabbat clans now. Then again I backed it up by making the anarchs have some actual ideas on how to achieve a more egalitarian society going forward.</div> </div> </div> </div>I downplayed this as well. The Sabbat DID lose several important cities in my game, but didn't even come close to collapsing. A small group of Lasombra DID betray the Sabbat, but by no means did the clan en masse switch sects.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-27T01:37:13-07:00","id":1518886,"title":"","content":"A returned/refromed Capadocian (or Hecate) and Salubri (anti or anything you can gather around the world and from dusty crypts) strong presence in the Sabbat replacing the Tzimsice and Lasombra could be a very scary especially if you add the Ravnos survivors<br /> A Sabbat tempered and guided by that Triumvirate of Clans would be effective as hell","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-27T03:03:49-07:00","id":1518902,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadeprowler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1518735-playing-v5-sabbat?p=1518886#post1518886\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A returned/refromed Capadocian (or Hecate) and Salubri (anti or anything you can gather around the world and from dusty crypts) strong presence in the Sabbat replacing the Tzimsice and Lasombra could be a very scary especially if you add the Ravnos survivors<br /> A Sabbat tempered and guided by that Triumvirate of Clans would be effective as hell</div> </div> </div> </div>My general approach is the tzmisce and lasombra are still Sabbat clans....largely because I don't think the defections really add anything to the setting . The Ravnos' pragmatic streak and warrior Salubri nobility bouncing off the the other lasombra megalomania and tzmisce sophilstic sadism.<br /> <br /> the heceta i tend to layout on a sect to sect basis.<br /> <br /> Harbingers and milliners are Sabbat<br /> <br /> Cappadocians are slowly gravitating to the Carmarilla and are expected to formally invited at the next Vienna meeting.<br /> <br /> Samedia are independent but have strong links with the anarchs.<br /> <br /> Naraja are ashirra due to geography<br /> <br /> Giovanni are largely independant.<br /> <br /> Lamia are resuming their roles as guardians with the harbingers, cappadocians and samedi so are found in all sects.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 07-27-2023, 06:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-27T05:42:28-07:00","id":1518922,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1518735-playing-v5-sabbat?p=1518842#post1518842\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I downplayed this as well. The Sabbat DID lose several important cities in my game, but didn't even come close to collapsing. A small group of Lasombra DID betray the Sabbat, but by no means did the clan en masse switch sects.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah that's what I went with effectively the kings and Queens of shadow descretly slicked off and effectively bribed their way into the carmarilla. I then combined this increased links with the Ashirra/Muslim immigration to bring in a slow trickle of middle Eastern lasombra which creates a solid presence in the carmarilla. Its been agreed that Montano has a seat on the inner council with a joint assamite/lasombra rotational justiciar.<br /> (the hidden price of this seat is montano is expected to terminate ul shulgi)<br /> Lasombra typically find themselves denied positions are carving a niche as street muscle due to the drop in gangrel and brujah.<br /> <br /> the courts of blood is pan sect and a deeply guarded secret.<br /> <br /> Lasombra Sabbat are now ironically having to get more involved with kine management following the defection and are having to deal with more challanges from the tzmisce and ventrue antitribu","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 07-29-2023, 04:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-28T09:24:15-07:00","id":1519036,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yab</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1518735-playing-v5-sabbat?p=1518835#post1518835\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I do like the idea of the Ravnos and Salubri antitribu becoming more prominent within the Sabbat due to (at least by old canon) their Antedeluvians actually being destroyed. Has V5 covered why the Tzimisce are starting to recede from the Sabbat, if not so much as the Lasombra?</div> </div> </div> </div>It hasn't been told yet in the books yet as far as I know Yab. In our game the Tzimisce are largely independent of the sects and have mostly transactional agreements with certain members of the Camariila and the Anarchs and the rest of the time they are following there own plans.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-28T15:59:54-07:00","id":1519054,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuperSabbatST</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1518735-playing-v5-sabbat?p=1518822#post1518822\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Grand Admiral Thrawn you say...So Polonia then? lol</div> </div> </div> </div>I was thinking <b>Jalan-Aajav</b>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-28T17:03:43-07:00","id":1519057,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1518735-playing-v5-sabbat?p=1518826#post1518826\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/374164/Guide-to-the-Sabbat\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.storytellersvault.com/pr...-to-the-Sabbat</a> - This one is my preferred one when I have to play V5.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/374104/The-Sword-of-Caine-A-V5-Guide-to-the-Sabbat\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.storytellersvault.com/pr...-to-the-Sabbat</a> - Not my fave but others like<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/385327/The-Black-Hand-Playing-the-Sabbat\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.storytellersvault.com/pr...ing-the-Sabbat</a> - The &quot;official&quot; one....its almost as bad as the V5 Sabbat book. Avoid.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/394797/The-True-Hand\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.storytellersvault.com/pr.../The-True-Hand</a> - An...interesting...take on the True Black Hand....worth a look even if it might not be your cup of tea.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/386171/The-Three-Free-Clans-An-Alternate-Look-at-the-Sabbat\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.storytellersvault.com/pr...-at-the-Sabbat</a> - An alt-history version of the Sabbat...different...</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you for this. I can see that the Sabbat's basic and innate qualities, themes, characterfulness, and associated concepts and related ideas have indeed made a definite impression on the VtM players, and also the wider WoD community. <br /> <br /> About these books you have linked - they do clearly seem worth giving them a honest effort and thought. It is curious and good that there is a Tal'Mahe'Ra supplement, as well. This Sect is certainly complex, intricate, and interesting, and is definitely also a noteworthy and important part of the setting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-29T09:52:58-07:00","id":1519116,"title":"","content":"Grand Admiral Thrawn would make a fine Ventrue inmho.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user