ion. I think he's never had an ST who portrays them as anything other than monstrous hypocrites.<br /> <br /> Which, admittedly, is a fair interpretation past CHICAGO BY NIGHT when they were mostly very good people (Maldavis, Anita Wainwright, Damien).</div> </div> </div> </div>No i get that bit (the obvious rebuttal is anarchs genrally arnt anarchists), its white power structure in vtm that's the headscratcher. Is he referring to obligarchic power structures in vtm and how you can argue they roughly mimic irl obligarchic power structures?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 07-30-2023, 05:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-30T02:50:18-07:00","id":1519162,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1518735-playing-v5-sabbat?p=1519137#post1519137\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Real life Nestor Makhno was awesome (like tore the Red Army and the Whites a new arse for 3 years awesome) , now look at all the 'civil rights' characters in 1 and 2 edition, and you are left with a choice: either the writers were so incompetent they had difficulty signing checks, or they were deliberately portraying every civil rights era character who ended up embraced as a mentally deficient tool of the white power structure.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ehhhh, the anarchs arnt anarchists. They're more an umbrella term for dissident for anti carmarilla and formally anti Sabbat groups/individuals. The tricky part is philosophical praxis were they don't actually have any hard counters to the tendancy towards either kratocracy or obligarchy inherant within vampires and the issue your boss is immortal.<br /> <br /> Don't get me wrong I don't have a very high opinion of anarchs but i dont think measuring them as Anarchists is a good comparison.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 07-30-2023, 07:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-30T12:10:52-07:00","id":1519189,"title":"","content":"And in the end Ragged Robin they become just like mommy and daddy sire as my Malkavian who is a member of the Anarch Sect by default would say.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-na